---
/** Steps: three markers joined by a line: one done in ink, the current one on an ink contour, one waiting. */
---

<span class="cover-sheet cover-stack" style="width:200px; padding:20px 18px; --gap:12px">
  <span class="cover-line">
    <i class="cover-marker cover-marker-done"></i>
    <i class="cover-rule" style="flex:1; align-self:center"></i>
    <span class="cover-marker cover-marker-current">2</span>
    <i class="cover-rule" style="flex:1; align-self:center"></i>
    <span class="cover-marker">3</span>
  </span>
  <span class="cover-line" style="justify-content:space-between"><i class="cover-bar" style="width:28px"></i><i class="cover-bar cover-bar-strong" style="width:36px"></i><i class="cover-bar cover-bar-faint" style="width:28px"></i></span>
</span>
